[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Enemies/BossPhaseResource.cs" id="2_phase"]

; The oldest of the three, and the only one that changes what it DOES rather than just how fast it
; does it. It opens speaking the elder word alone — the fight it would rather have — and only at a
; third of its health does it stoop to ordinary dragonfire. That grant is the per-phase ability set
; earning its place: both spells already exist and are monster-only, so this is authored content,
; not invented content.
;
; It escalates least per stage. An ancient thing does not panic; it runs out of patience, which is
; what the long 240 s fuse is for.
